@startuml Edit Class Information by Admin
actor Admin
participant ": ClassManagementPage " as ClassManagementPage
participant ": Router " as Router
participant ": ClassGroupController " as ClassGroupController
participant ": ClassGroupService " as ClassGroupService
participant ": ClassGroupRepository " as ClassGroupRepository
database Database

Admin->ClassManagementPage: 1. Admin clicks to Edit Class
    activate Admin
    activate ClassManagementPage

ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 2. Render Edit Class Form with existing data

Admin->ClassManagementPage: 3. Update Class Information

Admin->ClassManagementPage: 4. Click "Cập nhật" button

ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 5. Validate required fields

alt valid input
    ClassManagementPage->Router: 5.1.1 Send PUT /api/classgroup/{id} with UpdateClassGroupDto
    deactivate ClassManagementPage
    activate Router

    Router->ClassGroupController: 5.1.2 Route Request to Controller
    deactivate Router
    activate ClassGroupController

    ClassGroupController->ClassGroupService: 5.1.3 UpdateAsync(dto)
    deactivate ClassGroupController
    activate ClassGroupService

    ClassGroupService->ClassGroupRepository: 5.1.4 GetByIdAsync(classGroupId)
    activate ClassGroupRepository
    ClassGroupRepository->Database: 5.1.5 Query ClassGroup by Id
    activate Database
    Database-->ClassGroupRepository: 5.1.6 Return ClassGroup
    deactivate Database
    ClassGroupRepository-->ClassGroupService: 5.1.7 Return ClassGroup entity
    deactivate ClassGroupRepository

    ClassGroupService->ClassGroupService: 5.1.8 Validate Class exists

    ClassGroupService->ClassGroupRepository: 5.1.9 IsExistsAsync(name, grade, academicYearId, excludeId)
    activate ClassGroupRepository
    ClassGroupRepository->Database: 5.1.10 Query ClassGroup WHERE Name = {name} AND Grade = {grade} AND AcademicYearId = {id} AND Id != {excludeId}
    activate Database
    Database-->ClassGroupRepository: 5.1.11 Return true/false
    deactivate Database
    ClassGroupRepository-->ClassGroupService: 5.1.12 Return exists result
    deactivate ClassGroupRepository

    ClassGroupService->ClassGroupService: 5.1.13 Update ClassGroup fields

    ClassGroupService->ClassGroupRepository: 5.1.14 UpdateAsync(classGroup)
    activate ClassGroupRepository

    ClassGroupRepository->Database: 5.1.15 UPDATE ClassGroup Record
    activate Database

    Database-->ClassGroupRepository: 5.1.16 ClassGroup Updated Successfully
    deactivate Database

    ClassGroupRepository-->ClassGroupService: 5.1.17 ClassGroup Updated
    deactivate ClassGroupRepository

    ClassGroupService->ClassGroupService: 5.1.18 Map to ClassGroupDto

    ClassGroupService-->ClassGroupController: 5.1.19 Return ClassGroupDto
    deactivate ClassGroupService
    activate ClassGroupController

    ClassGroupController-->Router: 5.1.20 Send Success Response
    activate Router
    deactivate ClassGroupController

    Router-->ClassManagementPage: 5.1.21 Class Information Updated Successfully
    activate ClassManagementPage
    deactivate Router

    ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 5.1.22 Show Success Message and Close Modal

    ClassManagementPage-->Admin: 5.1.23 Show Updated Class Information
    deactivate ClassManagementPage
    deactivate Admin
else invalid input
    ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 5.2.1 Show error toast
    ClassManagementPage-->Admin: 5.2.1.1 Display "Vui lòng điền đầy đủ thông tin"
    deactivate ClassManagementPage
    deactivate Admin
end
@enduml

